{"speciesId":368,"names":{"fr":"Rosabyss","es":"Gorebyss","en":"Gorebyss","ja":"サクラビス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GOREBYSS lives in the southern seas at extreme depths. Its body is built to withstand the enormous pressure of water at incredible depths. Because of this, this POKéMON’s body is unharmed by ordinary attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Although GOREBYSS is the very picture of elegance and beauty while swimming, it is also cruel. When it spots prey, this POKéMON inserts its thin mouth into the prey’s body and drains the prey of its body fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A GOREBYSS siphons the body fluids of prey through its thin, tubular mouth. Its light pink body color turns vivid when it finishes feeding."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its pink body becomes more vivid with the rise of water temperatures in the springtime."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its pink body becomes more vivid with the rise of water temperatures in the springtime."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Au printemps, son corps rose se fait plus vif sans que l’on sache pourquoi. Il vit au fond de la mer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Au printemps, son corps rose se fait plus vif sans que l’on sache pourquoi. Il vit au fond de la mer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Au printemps, son corps rose se fait plus vif sans que l’on sache pourquoi. Il vit au fond de la mer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en el fondo del mar. En primavera, su cuerpo rosado adquiere colores más vivos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"海の 底で 暮らしているが 春になると 体の ピンク色が なぜか 鮮やかに 色づく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa façon de se déplacer sous l’eau est d’une élégance incomparable. Du bout de sa fine bouche, il se nourrit des algues qui poussent entre les rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene una forma de nadar de lo más elegante. Se alimenta de las algas marinas que crecen entre las rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"泳ぐ 姿は とても 優雅。 細い 口で 岩場の すき間に 生えた 海藻を 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Rosabyss vit dans les profondeurs des mers du sud. Son corps est conçu pour supporter l’énorme pression des profondeurs abyssales. Du coup, le corps de ce Pokémon n’est pas endommagé par les attaques ordinaires."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gorebyss vive en los mares del sur, en lo más profundo; de ahí que tenga el cuerpo preparado para soportar la presión tan grande que hay en el fondo marino, y que no le hagan daño los ataques comunes."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gorebyss lives in the southern seas at extreme depths. Its body is built to withstand the enormous pressure of water at incredible depths. Because of this, this Pokémon’s body is unharmed by ordinary attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"南の 深海に 生息する ポケモン。 深海の 水圧に 鍛えられた 体は ちょっとの 攻撃では キズも つかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Même si Rosabyss est l’image même de l’élégance et de la beauté quand il nage, il est aussi très cruel. Quand il repère sa proie, ce Pokémon insère sa fine bouche dans le corps de sa proie et aspire ses fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aunque Gorebyss es la imagen de la elegancia y la belleza al nadar, es también la definición de la crueldad. Al detectar a su presa, este Pokémon le hinca los finos dientes que tiene y le absorbe los fluidos corporales."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Although Gorebyss is the very picture of elegance and beauty while swimming, it is also cruel. When it spots prey, this Pokémon inserts its thin mouth into the prey’s body and drains the prey of its body fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"泳ぐ 姿は 優雅で とても きれいだが 獲物を 見つけると 細い 口を 体に 刺し込んで 体液を ずるずる すするぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La température de l’eau influence la couleur de son corps. À Alola, elle est tellement vive qu’elle en est éblouissante."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su color de piel varía en base a la temperatura del agua, y los que viven en Alola adoptan colores tan vivos que llegan a deslumbrar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The color of its body changes with the water temperature. The coloration of Gorebyss in Alola is almost blindingly vivid."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"身体の 色は 水の 温度で 変化する。 アローラの サクラビスは まぶしいほど 鮮やかに 色付く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se nourrit en aspirant les fluides corporels de ses proies. Le reste tombe au fond de la mer, nourrissant ainsi d’autres Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Absorbe los fluidos corporales de su presa. Los restos que deja caen hasta el lecho marino y se convierten en alimento para otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sucks bodily fluids out of its prey. The leftover meat sinks to the seafloor, where it becomes food for other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"獲物の 体液を 吸う。 肉は 海底に 沈み 他の ポケモンの エサに なるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":368,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[5,"level-up",50],[6,"level-up",50],[7,"level-up",50],[8,"level-up",51],[9,"level-up",51],[10,"level-up",51],[11,"level-up",51],[12,"level-up",50],[13,"level-up",50],[14,"level-up",51],[15,"level-up",50],[16,"level-up",50],[17,"level-up",50],[18,"level-up",50],[23,"level-up",50]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0